hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17387","Haddathana Abd al-Malik ibn Amr, he said haddathana Zuhayr, meaning Ibn Muhammad, from Abd Allah, meaning Ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil, from Ata ibn Yasar, from Abi Malik al-Ashjai, from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), he said: The greatest misappropriation with Allah, Exalted is He, is a cubit of land, you find two men neighbors in land or in a house, and one cuts off a cubit from his companion's share, so when he cuts it, he is collared with it from seven earths till the Day of Resurrection."
